<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears BPH issue for bonds.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears BPH issue for bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Securities Commission (KPW) on Thursday cleared for public trade Bank Przemyslowo- Handlowy SA's new issue of 1.99 million shares to be exchanged for the bank's convertible bonds, KPW said in a statment.</p>
<p>The statment said each of the bonds, issued earlier this year with a nominal value of $1,000, could be exchange for 17.037 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
